      "text": "I can't promise yet but most people with a possible stroke, within the treatment window do well once it's treated properly. I think an urgent CT scan of the head makes sense here for possible stroke. I want a blood sugar test done that's for stroke symptoms. Call an ambulance now you need hospital immediately."
